WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,020
One potato for twenty units of stone

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:05,020
Okay, but I'd like to exchange five potatoes.

3
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:08,020
By the way, are your potatoes big potatoes or small potatoes?

4
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:10,020
A big potato is about the size of my hand

5
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:13,020
Use it to stew meat or bake it on a firewood pile. It's a choice.

6
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:15,020
Okay, let’s change to five

7
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:17,020
I'll give you one hundred units of stone here.

8
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:18,020
OK, happy cooperation

9
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:21,020
Ice transaction is successful, get stone multiplied by one hundred

10
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:23,020
Really good. I got one hundred stones.

11
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:26,020
Brother, add a friend and continue trading if necessary in the future.

12
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:28,020
ok no problem

13
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:43,910
It smells so good without seasoning
